      "UsesAmmoSameLocationOnly"
    ]
  },
  "StockRole": "Demon",
  "YangsThoughts": "The Solahma suit came out of Clan Sea Fox in 3120 for warriors who'd been washed out to solahma infantry. Its controls and seating are nearly the same as a 'Mech's, minus the neural helmet so that even MechWarriors with neural feedback injuries can run it, and it's styled after the Mad Cat on purpose. Underneath it's simple, with Clan standard armor on an Inner Sphere-style frame. While it's stable and easy to pilot many refuse to use the suite, despite that it carries over a ton of weapons.",
